  "description": "Instructions for use (brukermanual / bruksanvisning) for a product, tool or machine. Structure aligned with EN 82079-1 — identification, intended use, safety, operation, maintenance, troubleshooting. Distinct from the broader technical documentation package and from installation manuals.",
